2C15.1046 2 16 2.89543 16 4V13C16 14.1046 15.1046 15 14 15H3C1.89543 15 1 14.1046 1 13V4C1 2.89543 1.89543 2 3 2H14ZM2 13C2 13.5523 2.44772 14 3 14H14C14.5523 14 15 13.5523 15 13V6H2V13ZM9.56055 7.7002C9.72615 7.47939 10.0398 7.4342 10.2607 7.59961C10.4816 7.76522 10.5267 8.07891 10.3613 8.2998L7.36133 12.2998C7.19572 12.5206 6.88203 12.5658 6.66113 12.4004C6.44032 12.2348 6.39514 11.9211 6.56055 11.7002L9.56055 7.7002ZM5.14648 8.14648C5.34175 7.95122 5.65825 7.95122 5.85352 8.14648C6.04878 8.34175 6.04878 8.65825 5.85352 8.85352L4.70703 10L5.85352 11.1465C6.04878 11.3417 6.04878 11.6583 5.85352 11.8535C5.65825 12.0488 5.34175 12.0488 5.14648 11.8535L3.7168 10.4238C3.48301 10.1896 3.48302 9.81039 3.7168 9.57617L5.14648 8.14648ZM11.1465 8.14648C11.3417 7.95122 11.6583 7.95122 11.8535 8.14648L13.2832 9.57617C13.517 9.81038 13.517 10.1896 13.2832 10.4238L11.8535 11.8535C11.6583 12.0488 11.3417 12.0488 11.1465 11.8535C10.9512 11.6583 10.9512 11.3417 11.1465 11.1465L12.293 10L11.1465 8.85352C10.9512 8.65825 10.9512 8.34175 11.1465 8.14648ZM3 3C2.44772 3 2 3.44772 2 4V5H15V4C15 3.44772 14.5523 3 14 3H3Z" fill="var(--ww_base_gray_100)"></path></svg><span class="ep-scene-select-h5-item-text">企业自建应用开发<!----></span></a></div></div></div><div class="ep-layout-sidebar"><div id="js-ep-sidebar"><div class="ep-doc-select"><div level="0" class="ep-doc-wrap"><a href="/document/path/90968" class="ep-doc-item"> 加解密方案说明 </a><!----></div><div level="0" class="ep-doc-wrap"><a href="/document/path/90312" class="ep-doc-item"> 访问频率限制 </a><!----></div><div level="0" class="ep-doc-wrap"><a href="/document/path/90313" class="ep-doc-item" selected="selected"> 全局错误码 </a><!----></div><div level="0" class="ep-doc-wrap"><a href="/document/path/90314" class="ep-doc-item"> 企业规模与行业信息 </a><!----></div><div level="0" class="ep-doc-wrap"><a href="/document/path/90315" class="ep-doc-item"> 常见问题 - FAQ </a><!----></div><div level="0" class="ep-doc-wrap"><a href="/document/path/90311" class="ep-doc-item"> 与企业号接口差异 </a><!----></div><div level="0" class="ep-doc-wrap"><a href="/document/path/94555" class="ep-doc-item"> 深色模式适配指南 </a><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="ep-layout-cnt"><div id="js-ep-doc-area" class="ep-doc-area"><div class="ep-route-dir"><div class="ep-route-dir-item"><span>企业自建应用开发</span><svg width="7" height="10" viewBox="0 0 7 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.24264 1.00004L5.48528 5.24268L1.24264 9.48532" stroke="var(--ww_base_gray_060)" stroke-opacity="0.5"></path></svg></div><div class="ep-route-dir-item"><span>附录</span><svg width="7" height="10" viewBox="0 0 7 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.24264 1.00004L5.48528 5.24268L1.24264 9.48532" stroke="var(--ww_base_gray_060)" stroke-opacity="0.5"></path></svg></div><div class="ep-route-dir-item"><span>全局错误码</span><svg width="7" height="10" viewBox="0 0 7 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M1.24264 1.00004L5.48528 5.24268L1.24264 9.48532" stroke="var(--ww_base_gray_060)" stroke-opacity="0.5"></path></svg></div></div><div id="js-ep-doc-card"><div class="ep-doc-card-list">
